{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a testimonials reviews carousel section called "Experiences of homeowners" matching Huisunie.nl. Must be a fully functional infinite looping slider.
    
    SECTION BACKGROUND: Warm cream beige #F5F0EB, centered, 80px padding top and bottom.
    
    SECTION STRUCTURE:
    1. Centered inline rating: "Rated 9.5" + 5 gold stars ★★★★★ inline no box
    2. Large bold centered heading: "Experiences of homeowners" dark navy #0D2B5E
    3. Slider: 4 white cards desktop, arrows on outer sides
    4. Dot indicators centered below cards
    
    SLIDER REQUIREMENTS (critical):
    - Infinite loop: clone slides for seamless looping in both directions
    - Smooth CSS transform translateX transition
    - Left ‹ and right › circular outlined navy arrow buttons on sides
    - Dot indicators: active filled navy, inactive gray outline, clickable
    - Touch swipe support mobile
    - Auto-play every 5 seconds, pause on hover
    
    4 REVIEW CARD BLOCKS (each separate editable block):
    Card layout: white bg, 12px rounded, soft shadow, 24px padding, flex column
    - Top: 5 gold stars #F5C518
    - Middle: review text dark gray
    - Bottom: navy circle avatar (white initial) + bold name + gray location
    
    Card1: "Absolutely love this! It exceeded all my expectations and the quality is outstanding. Highly recommend to anyone looking for excellence." S Sarah Johnson New York
    Card2: "Great experience from start to finish. The customer service was exceptional and the quality is top-notch. Will definitely come back again!" M Michael Chen San Francisco
    Card3: "I'm so impressed with this. The attention to detail is remarkable and it has made such a difference. Five stars without hesitation!" E Emma Williams London
    Card4: "Outstanding quality and service! This has been one of my best experiences this year. The team really cares about their customers." D David Martinez Miami
    
    ARROWS: 44px circular, 2px solid #0D2B5E border, white bg, navy chevron icon, vertically centered on card row sides
    
    DOTS: centered below, margin-top 24px, 10px circles, active filled #0D2B5E, inactive 2px border #0D2B5E transparent fill, 8px gap, clickable
    
    RESPONSIVE: 4 cards desktop, 2 cards tablet 768px, 1 card mobile 480px with swipe
    
    STYLING: Use var(--font-heading-family) and var(--font-body-family) Horizon CSS variables
    
    IMPORTANT: Do NOT use CSS class names with ai- prefix. Vanilla JS only no libraries. Each review card separate schema block. JS must handle: next, prev, dot click, autoplay, pause on hover, infinite loop via cloned slides, touchstart touchend swipe.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

